### 1. List available stock items
GET http://localhost:8080/api/inventario
Accept: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: test-corr-inv-list

### 2. Get single stock item by SKU
GET http://localhost:8080/api/inventario/SKU-KEYBOARD
Accept: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: test-corr-inv-get

### 3. Reserve stock for an order
POST http://localhost:8080/api/inventario/reservas
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: test-corr-inv-reserve

{
  "orderId": 1001,
  "lines": [
    {
      "sku": "SKU-KEYBOARD",
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

### 4. Release order reservation (compensation)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/inventario/reservas/1001/liberacion
Accept: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: test-corr-inv-release

### 5. Adjust stock availability (replenishment)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/inventario/SKU-KEYBOARD
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: test-corr-inv-adjust

{
  "quantity": 100
}
